/-! ## Foundation for equation (9.14): Hadamard's determinant inequality

Higham, 2nd ed., section 9.4, states Wilkinson's complete-pivoting growth-factor
upper bound (9.14) `ρ_n^c ≤ n^{1/2}(2·3^{1/2}⋯n^{1/(n-1)})^{1/2}` with only a
