  higham9_27_GMatrix_ratio_le_product_ratio Linv ΔA Uinv
    (opNorm2_nonneg Linv) (opNorm2_nonneg ΔA) (opNorm2_nonneg Uinv)
    (opNorm2Le_opNorm2 Linv) (opNorm2Le_opNorm2 ΔA)
    (opNorm2Le_opNorm2 Uinv) heta

/-- **Equation (9.27)**, native `Matrix`-product exact-operator-norm
Frobenius bridge for `G = L⁻¹ ΔA U⁻¹`. -/
theorem higham9_27_matrix_mul_frobenius_le_exact_opNorm2_product {n : ℕ}
